The [[White Lily Collar]] is a [[Ranger]] [[Accessory]] which is an upgrade of the [[Acorn Collar]]. Normally obtained by combining the [[Acorn Collar]] with [[Holy Armor]], the other upgrades of the [[Acorn Collar]] (the [[Blue Sage Collar]] and [[Red Orchid Collar]]) can also be converted to the [[White Lily Collar]] in the same way.

Like all collar items, it cares about {{icon/luck}}, in this case generating {{icon/luck}} and {{icon/regeneration}} from item activations. Additionally, it provides {{icon/star}} items 1% critical hit chance for each {{icon/luck}} and {{icon/regeneration}}. 

Quickly triggering items of any kind will be most useful for generating {{icon/luck}} and {{icon/regeneration}} with this, but damaging items will be required to benefit from the critical hit chance.

The [[Acorn Ace]] skill gives the [[White Lily Collar]] and the other collars more {{icon/star}} slots.
